    {
      "name": "six_starts_per_hour_stays_clear",
      "description": "Boundary, low side. The compressor runs 2 minutes every 10 — exactly six starts an hour, the reference's minimum recommended interval met exactly. count lands on exactly 6.0 (60.0 x 6 x 60 / 3600 is exact in IEEE-754) and max_starts_per_hour is a strict `>`, so six starts an hour reads clear. During the warm-up window the extrapolated pace is 6.0 or a hair under, never above",
